{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enriched","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enricher","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","text":"Destination","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"What each record this destination receives adds to its context.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"enricher"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A destination that hands this one each batch with its records enriched.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(","    to: ownBackend.enriched(by: Enricher { $0[RegionKey.self] = \"eu-west\" }),","    vendor",")"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The enricher runs on each record of a batch as the delivery hands the batch to this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination, not on the tracker’s worker, so what it sets reaches this destination alone:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the others are handed the same records without it. It runs on every record the destination"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receives, records a store recovered from an earlier run included, and reads any value it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"computes at delivery rather than when the event was tracked. So it suits values about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination or the delivery, such as a region or a deployment tag, rather than about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event: a recovered record would get this run’s app version and the network at upload time."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Like the other modifiers, the one applied last sees each record first: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"destination.enriched(by: first).enriched(by: second)"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"second"},{"text":" runs, then ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"first"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sees what ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"second"},{"text":" set and has the last word on a key both set.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Records the enricher adds before a record, as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Enricher.sessions()"},{"type":"text","text":" adds "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionStarted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionEnded"},{"type":"text","text":", are left out: they would reach the destination without passing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker’s consent, samplers or store. Given such an enricher, this logs a warning once, as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it is called. Give that kind of enricher to the tracker instead."}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Complexity","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"text":") enricher calls for a batch of ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"text":" records.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"This destination, receiving each record with its context changed by ","type":"text"},{"code":"enricher","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enriched","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV","text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP","text":"Destination","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:12Destinations11DestinationPAAE8enriched2byQr6Events8EnricherV_tF","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Enriched.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Destinations\/Enriched.swift#L34"},"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Destinations"}],"role":"symbol","title":"enriched(by:)","extendedModule":"Destinations"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations","doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/enriched(by:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/destinations\/destination\/enriched(by:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Destination":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Destination","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Destination","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Destination","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where a delivery sends events: a plain sink that records the batches it receives."}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/destination","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations/Destination/enriched(by:)":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"enriched(by:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations\/Destination\/enriched(by:)","url":"\/documentation\/destinations\/destination\/enriched(by:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This destination, receiving each record with its context changed by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enricher"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enriched","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events8EnricherV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Destination","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12Destinations11DestinationP"}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Enricher":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Enricher","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Enricher","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Adds to the context of each event a tracker tracks, before the record is delivered."}],"url":"\/documentation\/events\/enricher","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Enricher"},"doc://Destinations/documentation/Destinations":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Where tracked events go: the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Destination"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the modifiers that narrow what a destination receives, and the delivery that hands it batches."}],"url":"\/documentation\/destinations","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"Destinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/Destinations\/documentation\/Destinations"}}}